let dragon be the fn dragon_p list frame
    lambda p take nat_to_whole xii layer
        layer
            cycle entirely by xxiv shift east dragon_tail p
            cycle entirely
                shift_by pos xxi pos vii
                loop center_head p
        cycle entirely shift_by pos xxvii pos iv layer
            right_half p
            for vi rotate entirely
                compose
                    shift west
                    flip_over_y
                right_half p

